{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "snow-country",
  "chunk_id": "snow-country-chunk-0609",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我不晓得你们三人之间有什么关系，但少爷眼下不是快死了吗！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I do not know what relationship there is among the three of you, but is the young master not on the verge of death right now!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "所以他想见见你，才让人叫你的嘛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is why he wants to see you, and why someone was sent to call you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "乖乖回去吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Go back quietly now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "不然会后悔一辈子的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Otherwise you will regret it for the rest of your life.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "说不定在我们说话之间，他就断气了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For all we know, while we are standing here talking, he may breathe his last.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "那怎么办呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What will you do then?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00609",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "别固执了，干脆让一切都付诸东流吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Stop being stubborn, and simply let everything be washed away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
